tra is a cybersecurity company like no other. We're creating a simpler, stronger future for our customers. Our trusted experts\nand portfolio of integrated, scalable solutions bring balance and control to organizations around the world. We're the positive\nchangemakers and your relentless ally to provide peace of mind through every step of your cybersecurity journey.\nContact: Wilson Prevette\nPhone:\nEmail: wilson.prevette@fortra.com\nPage 2 of 3\nFORTRA\nFortra, LLC\nInvoice\n11095 Viking Drive, Suite 100\nTax ID: 30-0290533\nEden Prairie, MN 55344\nPhone: +1 952-933-0609\nUnited States\nwww.fortra.com\nDate: 21-Apr-25\nAccount: Consolidated Analytics\nInvoice #: V0000301683\nNet Terms: 30 Days\nPayment Due: 21-May-25\n(00242655)\nBilling Info\nACH or WIRE:\nSEND CHECKS TO:\nPanneer Selvam\nACH Routing #: 124001545 (UT)\nDomestic (US) Checks Only:\nConsolidated Analytics\nWire Routing #: 021000021\n1 MacArthur Place\nFortra, LLC\nAccount #: 895537857\nP.O. Box 735324\nSte 100\nSWIFT ID: CHASUS33\nSanta Ana, Texas 92707\nChicago, IL 60673-5324\nBank: J.P.Morgan\nUnited States\nCity & State: New York, New York\nEmail Remittances:\nPhone:\n949-988-7204\nFortraLLC.eremit@jpmchase.com\nand accountsreceivable@fortra.com\nPurchase Order ID:\nEmail:\npselvam@ca-usa.com\nShip To:\nCalifornia, United States\nCurrency: USD\nDescription\nPrice\nDiscount\nAmount\nHardware ID: DGIZ-GASQ-YWGQ-ERNQ System Type: Production\nSubscriptions\nProduct\nQty\nStart Date\nEnd Date\nGoAnywhere Starter Bundle with Gateway - Subscription\n1\n1-May-25\n30-Apr-26\n19,843.49\n(1,091.40)\n18,752.09\nSubtotal\n19,843.49\n(1,091.40)\n18,752.09\nTax\n0.00\nAmount Due\n18,752.09\nCurrency: USD\nContact: Wilson Prevette\nPhone:\nEmail: wilson.prevette@fortra.com\nPage 3 of 3..."}
