ection Appeals Program (CAP) before the\ncollection action takes place. Please call 833-678-7020 or send us a Collection Appeal\nRequest (Form 9423). Note: The (CAP) is different from the Collection Due Process\n022019\n(CDP) Program. Please call 833-678-7020 if you have questions about ei...'}
