2026-04-29 19:51:18,717 | INFO | ai_app | {'request_id': '7f340d14-486a-4fbe-8967-204132012944', 'stage': 'azure_ocr_text_extracted', 'invoice_id': 7020, 'raw_ocr_text': "S Guardian®\nHAWAII DISABILITY BENEFIT\nPREMIUM REPORT - QUARTERLY\nRGO\nA/R\nPOLICY NUMBER\nGROUP ID\nDIVISION ID\nPERIOD BEGINNING\nPERIOD ENDING\nPAYMENT DUE DATE\n019\nBBE\n00898680-0000\n00898680\n0000\n01/01/2026\n03/31/2026\n04/01/2026\nCONSOLIDATED ANALYTICS, INC.\nJUDY HSU\n1 MACARTHUR PL STE 100\nSANTA ANA CA 92707-5928\nIf the above contact or address is not correct or has recently changed, please email updated information to SMD_Team@glic.com.\nA. EMPLOYEE DATA\nMONTH\nJAN\nFEB\nMAR\nTOTAL # OF\nEMPLOYEES\nMALES\n1\n0\n0\n1\nFEMALES\n0\n0\n0\n0\nB. TOTAL GROSS WAGES\nThe total gross wages paid to all covered employees\n$14,583.33\nduring the billing period indicated above.\nQUARTERLY PREMIUM CALCULATION\nC. TOTAL COVERED WAGES\nTotal of all wages paid in the period indicated above to employees covered by this\npolicy, not exceeding your state's maximum wage base of $1,441.72 per employee per\n$5,766.88\nweek, or $6,247.45 per employee per month or $18,742.36 per employee per quarter.\nD. Premium Rate per $100:\n$0.00300\nE. SUBTOTAL PREMIUM DUE: (Multiply Line C by Line D)\n$17.30\nF. TOTAL QUARTERLY PREMIUM DUE:\n(Greater of the amount on Line E OR The Minimum Quarterly Premium of $10.00)\n$17.30\nSUBMIT PREMIUM DUE WITH COMPLETED PREMIUM REPORT TO (include the 12 digit policy number on your check):\nThe Guardian Life Insurance Company of America\nState Mandated Benefits\nPrepared by:\nJudy Hsu\nP.O. Box 824418\nPhone Number:\n949-988-7230\nPhiladelphia, PA 19182-4418\nEmail Address:\njhsu@ca-usa.com\nLog on or register at www.guardiananytime.com to view premium reports, make payments and more on your active policies.\nInstructions for completing this premium statement are located on the reverse side of this document.\nIf you require further assistance, please contact Guardian at 888-278-4542.\nHIPQS\nA\nA\nINSTRUCTIONS FOR COMPLETION OF THE PREMIUM REPORT\n1. Enter in A, the Employee Data Box, the number of covered employees, noting males and females\nseparately for each month of the Quarter within the billing period referenced on this statement.\n2. Enter in B, Total Gross Wages, the total gross wages paid to all insured employees during the noted\nbilling period. Include wages, board, lodging or any form of payment received by an employee, as well\nas commissions, bonuses and tips or gratuities which are customary and expected in a particular type\nof employment and are reported to the employer for payroll tax deduction purposes.\n3. Enter in C, Total Covered Wages, the taxable wages paid to all insured employees during the noted\nbilling period.\n4. Multiply the covered wages entered in C by the rate provided in D, Subtotal Premium Due.\n5. Compare the amount on Line E to the Minimum Quarterly Premium. Enter the greater amount on\nLine F. This is your Total Quarterly Premium Due for the noted billing period...."}
